Blocking Angle [text box]
Type in the Blocking Angle in degrees which the PickAndPlace robot cannot cross while rotating. This
prevents the robot from taking the shortest way.
Remarks
The default setting -1 means that no blocking angle applies and that the robot thus takes the shortest way.
You can type in an angle between 0 and 360 degrees.
The Blocking Angle only affects the animation, the simulation is controlled by the rotation times which
you defined in the Times Table.
