Capacity [text box] - PickAndPlace
Type the Capacity into the text box, i.e., the number of MUs that the PickAndPlace robot can transport at
any one time.
Remarks
The Capacity enables the PickAndPlace robot to transport more than one part at the same time. It might,
for example, pick up a number of bottles and place them into the appropriate slots of a bottle crate one at
a time (FIFO).
Type in a number greater than 1.
If you want to unload the parts according to another rule, for example LIFO, you can program this in an
Exit Control.
